Package: GPcluster
Type: Package
Title: Clustered Gaussian Process
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: person("Chih-Li", "Sung", email = "iamdfchile@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits clustered Gaussian process models for nonstationary responses
    and large computer experiments using a stochastic expectation-maximization
    algorithm. Provides predictions, predictive intervals, and leave-one-out
    cross-validation diagnostics. See Sung, Haaland, Hwang, and Lu (2023)
    <doi:10.5705/ss.202020.0456>.
License: GPL-2 | GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.1)
Imports:
    MASS,
    mlegp,
    nnet,
    foreach
URL: https://github.com/ChihLi/GPcluster
BugReports: https://github.com/ChihLi/GPcluster/issues
